WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.042
Telangana Bhu Bharati provides Record of Rights and passbook services. Capture the version you actually viewed.

00:00:08.042 --> 00:00:14.708
Match the ePPB or khata, Pattadar, village, and complete survey subdivision.

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:22.458
Compare extent, history, and any transaction or prohibited-property status with deeds and the LPM.

00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:31.500
A passbook display is one record layer. A disputed claim or restriction needs the competent authority and qualified review.
